-### Build an Outline (Bookmark) Tree
-
-```cpp
-#include <aspose/pdf/outline_collection.hpp>
-#include <aspose/pdf/outline_item_collection.hpp>
-#include <aspose/pdf/annotations/xyz_explicit_destination.hpp>
-
